        {
          "id": "t12",
          "x": 42,
          "y": 203,
          "width": 355,
          "height": 265,
          "rotation": 0,
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The best stories are the ones we make together.\n\nSay yes to the impromptu road trip. Take the blurry photograph. Keep the ticket stub. Write down the funny thing before you forget it.\n\nThere is so much beauty in an ordinary day.",
          "style": "body"
        },
